 "title": null,
 "text": "## Best practices\n\n- Use toolbar as a grouping element only if the group contains 3 or more controls. Refer to ['toolbar aria practices'](https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-practices-1.2/#toolbar) for details.\n- Label each toolbar when the application contains more than one toolbar (using `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby` props). Refer to [toolbar(role)](https://www.w3.org/WAI/PF/aria/roles#toolbar) for details.",
 "format": "md"
 }
